# Review: Supertraining Chapter 6d (6.12-6.17), 25 entries

Reviewer: Claude Opus (independent, instructed to falsify). Date: 2026-10-03.
Scope: the 25 files in `staging/_scope_supertraining_ch6d.txt`, folder `staging/library/strength-and-conditioning/supertraining--verkhoshansky/`.
Source: `staging/books/supertraining-6th-expanded.pdf`, PDF idx 379-403 (printed 368-392), plus PDF 305, 340, 375 and 378 for cross-references. PDF idx = printed + 11.

Method: text layer for every quote (all 25 entries' quotes compared against it). Page images opened at 200 dpi: PDF 383, 386, 387, 388, 389, 392, 393, 394, 395, 396, 397, 398, 399, 400. PDF 379-382, 384, 385, 390, 391 and 401-403 were checked by text layer and italic-span scan only; none carries a figure or table value an entry depends on (Table 6.6 at PDF 391 is cited by name only). Fig 6.39 at 300 dpi plus 450-dpi crops of both panels (`_renders/r6d_p395_upper.png`, `_renders/r6d_p395_lower.png`); Fig 6.32(b) at 450 dpi (`_renders/r6d_p383_figb.png`); PDF 392 and 393 (Tables 6.7-6.12) read from the images. Italics checked with a font-span scan (PDF 379, 382, 384, 385, 399, 400, 402: every "italics in the original" claim is correct). Every "Eric's baseline:" quote checked against `docs/method-baseline.md` lines 30, 32, 33, 34, 74, 75, 89, 101, 103, 105, 106, 115, 116, 117, 181, 182, 183, 185, 186, 187, 188: all quotes, line numbers and tags are correct. The Issurin 2016 brief (`research-papers/issurin-2016-...md`), the Issurin stage entry, and the Evans/Bompa cycle-types entry were opened, and every quote from them matches. All wikilinks in the 25 files resolve. Em dashes appear only in the six section headers of each file.

Counts: **14 GO, 11 FIX, 0 NO-GO.**

